[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]未入太祖庙考[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]史料背景[/font][/b]


曹魏先后两次拟定进入太祖庙祭祀的名单：

[indent]•  [color=#000000]第一批（明帝时期）：[/color] 夏侯惇、曹仁、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "程昱", "cat": "people"}]程昱[/url][/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]第二批（正始四年243年）：[/color] 二十人，含典韦、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张辽", "cat": "people"}]张辽[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "乐进", "cat": "people"}]乐进[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "于禁", "cat": "people"}]于禁[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "徐晃", "cat": "people"}]徐晃[/url][/color]、张郃、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "庞德", "cat": "people"}]庞德[/url][/color]等，典韦在列，许褚不在[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]裴松之的批评（唯一一手评价）[/font][/b]


[indent][color=#666666]┃ "徐他谋逆而许褚心动，忠诚之至远同于日磾，且潼关之危，非褚不济，褚之功烈有过典韦。今祀韦而不及褚，又所未达也。"[/color][/indent]


裴松之明确认为：许褚功绩超过典韦，未能入祀是无法解释的现象。


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]原因分析（均为推断，无正史明文）[/font][/b]


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]曹仁积怨说：[/color] 拒绝私谈一事曹仁"意忿之"，宗室在评定时可能无人为许褚说话[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000]孤臣无援说：[/color] 许褚一生谨守内臣之职，无政治结盟，身后乏人替他表功[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000]子孙补偿说：[/color] 许仪、许综顺利继爵，可能被视为已获补偿[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000]结论：[/color] 永不可从正史单方定论，属永久开放悬案[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


